# No client names in skills

Public skills are product documentation. Do not name specific **clients** or **accounts**.

Use placeholders: `<account_id>`, `<parent_account_id>`, `<prefix>`, `engine9-accounts/<org>/<account>/export`.

Fine to name: engine9 product terms, plugin/vendor integrations (paths, `plugin_id`), and table/column identifiers.

```
# ❌ BAD
e9 exportworker export -a liftoff \
  --definition_path=engine9-accounts/frakture/liftoff/hockeystick/export
Email bundles (Hockeystick) typically ship EMAIL_* stores.

# ✅ GOOD
e9 exportworker export -a <account_id> \
  --definition_path=engine9-accounts/<org>/<account>/export
Email-oriented bundles typically ship EMAIL_* stores.
```
